AB  - Computer big data technology is widely used in sports. The article uses football as an example to analyse the application of computer big data technology. The article establishes a small group robot soccer simulation platform based on OpenGL. The modelling of the simulation platform is simple and intuitive. It uses the ray tracing algorithm to realize the collision detection of the world model. It also accurately simulates the robot’s motion and ball control performance, and realizes a variety of human-computer interaction functions. Practice shows that the competition system has the advantages of low cost, good control performance, and strong interest, which can effectively stimulate students’ enthusiasm for learning.
